{"issue": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1702", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1702/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1702/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1702/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1702", "id": 1145690143, "node_id": "I_kwDOBabE0s5ESdgf", "number": 1702, "title": "Add set flight mode to public API?", "user": {"login": "reedev", "id": 2393764, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjIzOTM3NjQ=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2393764?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev", "html_url": "https://github.com/reedev", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "labels": [], "state": "closed", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 7, "created_at": "2022-02-21T11:43:54Z", "updated_at": "2022-08-31T10:25:49Z", "closed_at": "2022-03-01T17:53:42Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "issue_field_values": [], "type": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "sub_issues_summary": {"total": 0, "completed": 0, "percent_completed": 0}, "issue_dependencies_summary": {"blocked_by": 0, "total_blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "Hi @julianoes \r\n\r\nI found https://discuss.px4.io/t/is-it-possible-to-set-other-flight-modes-stabilized-hold-etc/17338/2 and would like to follow up here, in the context of MAVSDK.\r\n\r\nI was looking for the same functionality and I think I have a use case: when I am in mission mode and I pause the mission, the flight mode is implicitly put into Hold. And that means that the drone will return to the location where it was when pause was issued, and it will turn around too.\r\n\r\nI want to go into Position flight mode and accept that the drone is not exactly in the location where the pause cmd was issued. For me, it's not an issue to back up a bit manually after the mission has been paused.\r\n\r\nCould you add SystemImpl::set_flight_mode() to System? Or am I missing an important point here?\r\n\r\nOn second thought, following the current design, I guess it would be better to add a method to the Mission? I am more then happy to make such a change and submit a PR (never done this before but that's ok). Please let me know.\r\n\r\nThanks, cheers,\r\nRaymond\r\n", "closed_by": {"login": "reedev", "id": 2393764, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjIzOTM3NjQ=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2393764?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev", "html_url": "https://github.com/reedev", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1702/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1702/timeline", "performed_via_github_app": null, "state_reason": "completed", "pinned_comment": null}, "comments": [{"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/1046876583", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1702#issuecomment-1046876583", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1702", "id": 1046876583, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s4-ZhGn", "user": {"login": "JonasVautherin", "id": 2606672, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI2MDY2NzI=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2606672?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin", "html_url": "https://github.com/JonasVautherin", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2022-02-21T13:22:52Z", "updated_at": "2022-02-21T13:22:52Z", "body": "> On second thought, following the current design, I guess it would be better to add a method to the Mission? I am more then happy to make such a change and submit a PR (never done this before but that's ok). Please let me know.\r\n\r\nSo the root issue is that pausing the mission gives a suboptimal user experience, right? One question is: do we ever want the current behavior where it flies back, or should this be considered a bug instead?", "author_association": "COLLABORATOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/1046876583/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/1046883288", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1702#issuecomment-1046883288", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1702", "id": 1046883288, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s4-ZivY", "user": {"login": "reedev", "id": 2393764, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjIzOTM3NjQ=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2393764?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev", "html_url": "https://github.com/reedev", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2022-02-21T13:29:38Z", "updated_at": "2022-02-21T13:29:38Z", "body": "Indeed, that is the question. The PX4 spec says that the flight mode should be Hold when a mission is paused: https://docs.px4.io/master/en/flight_modes/mission.html so I guess when the current behaviour is changed it might break for others.\r\n\r\nSo I guess the suggested behaviour is a MAVSDK specific change. What do you think?", "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/1046883288/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/1047754984", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1702#issuecomment-1047754984", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1702", "id": 1047754984, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s4-c3jo", "user": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2022-02-22T12:38:55Z", "updated_at": "2022-