.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1702", "id": 1046883288, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s4-ZivY", "user": {"login": "reedev", "id": 2393764, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjIzOTM3NjQ=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2393764?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev", "html_url": "https://github.com/reedev", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2022-02-21T13:29:38Z", "updated_at": "2022-02-21T13:29:38Z", "body": "Indeed, that is the question. The PX4 spec says that the flight mode should be Hold when a mission is paused: https://docs.px4.io/master/en/flight_modes/mission.html so I guess when the current behaviour is changed it might break for others.\r\n\r\nSo I guess the suggested behaviour is a MAVSDK specific change. What do you think?", "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/1046883288/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null, "event": "commented", "actor": {"login": "reedev", "id": 2393764, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjIzOTM3NjQ=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2393764?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.githu